==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] should definitely be in your lineup since he is the best counter to this stage while taking up only 1 slot. As for the Zang Roos, you could equip Holyblast but that means you will have it for all possible continuation stages so the best way to go about it is to simply make it burrow early so it won't traverse too much. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] in particular is amazing for the Zang Roos with savage blow, as her great attack power and Crowd-Control capabilities is enough to help you throughout the stage and the previous ones too.

